{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301091","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301091","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1430109101:1":{"text":"村で開かれる鍛冶対決だ。制限時間内に武器を作って、審査員に評価してもらうんだ。","source_cn":"就是咱们村里举办的比拼锻造的大赛，大家在规定的时间里锻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5821041D1B0BF04B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430109102:1":{"text":"小さい村だけど、一流の鍛冶職人揃いだよ。","source_cn":"别看咱们村子不大，但个顶个都是好手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FF2EE86DA11119A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430109103:1":{"text":"ダイン、君も出るのか？ハガルドもロックフィストも出場するって聞いたけど。","source_cn":"达因，你也想参加锻魂大赛吗？我可听说铁须和石拳都会参加。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F44914209B372A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1430109104:1":{"text":"なに、あいつらも？あの実力なら、審査員やる側だろ……！","source_cn":"他们两个也参加？他们的实力都够当大赛的评委了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78E59B18FC547506","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠达因":{"text":"職人のダイン","source":"工匠达因","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:工匠卡尔林":{"text":"職人のカリン","source":"工匠卡尔林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}